WEBVTT

01:29.470 --> 01:33.120
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.640 --> 01:36.250
[Episode 14]

01:36.840 --> 01:38.190
[Qunhua Hall]

02:13.560 --> 02:15.180
Judging from how they look,

02:15.200 --> 02:17.150
I don't think they're much better than us.

02:17.150 --> 02:19.610
One, two, three, four.

02:19.880 --> 02:21.240
Plus President Wan,

02:21.270 --> 02:23.310
there are eight of them in total.

02:23.440 --> 02:24.720
But we only have seven people.

02:24.720 --> 02:26.760
Will our formation look bad?

02:26.760 --> 02:27.760
What are you afraid of?

02:27.760 --> 02:30.690
I think they're just putting on a front.

03:09.030 --> 03:14.600
Are you sure...
they're just putting on a front?

03:14.920 --> 03:18.390
I'm afraid we can't defeat them
on pure ability.

03:18.560 --> 03:19.360
In my opinion,

03:19.560 --> 03:21.360
we're definitely going to lose.

03:22.360 --> 03:23.290
How come...

03:23.980 --> 03:25.140
those two girls

03:25.160 --> 03:26.900
look familiar to me?

03:26.960 --> 03:28.560
They look familiar to me too.

03:34.440 --> 03:35.360
It's you lot!

03:35.360 --> 03:36.900
Run!

03:44.450 --> 03:45.570
P-President Wan.

03:47.000 --> 03:49.760
If you want to watch, do it openly.

03:50.120 --> 03:52.200
Why do you have to be so sneaky?

03:52.400 --> 03:55.400
President Wan,
they've always been like this—unruly

03:55.400 --> 03:56.360
and up to no good.

03:56.960 --> 03:58.520
How have you been, ladies?

03:58.760 --> 04:01.850
Little did I expect
to meet you two here again.

04:01.870 --> 04:03.260
It's all thanks to you.

04:03.290 --> 04:04.240
You didn't sign your name.

04:04.240 --> 04:05.600
So we became the champion.

04:05.600 --> 04:06.860
And we reached here effortlessly.

04:06.860 --> 04:07.900
The two of you are

04:08.320 --> 04:10.440
so smug after taking advantage of others.

04:10.440 --> 04:12.440
It's enough that you aren't grateful,

04:12.440 --> 04:14.970
but to kick us when we're down
is just too much.

04:16.890 --> 04:17.750
President Wan,

04:18.200 --> 04:20.040
they were shamelessly peeking at us.

04:20.040 --> 04:22.560
Such sneaky skulkers deserve punishment.

04:22.560 --> 04:25.400
We'll teach them a lesson
on President Wan's behalf.

04:25.400 --> 04:26.730
Don't you dare touch us!

04:26.920 --> 04:27.520
Who are you?

04:27.520 --> 04:29.000
How bold of you
for bringing a sharp weapon.

04:29.000 --> 04:30.960
How dare you commit assault
in President Wan's presence!

04:30.960 --> 04:31.760
Tu Ya!

04:32.600 --> 04:33.640
You can't do this.

04:34.800 --> 04:36.930
Stop pestering us,

04:37.360 --> 04:38.690
or I won't go easy on you.

04:39.920 --> 04:40.850
Tu Ya!

04:40.870 --> 04:42.730
-President Wan!
-President Wan!

04:48.800 --> 04:49.659
President Wan,

04:49.670 --> 04:50.950
our behavior today

04:50.970 --> 04:52.360
was indeed inappropriate.

04:52.360 --> 04:53.890
If that caused any offense,

04:54.560 --> 04:56.360
I'd like to apologize to you,

04:56.400 --> 04:58.920
President Wan, and everyone present here.

04:59.960 --> 05:00.680
President Wan,

05:00.680 --> 05:02.460
don't be fooled by her sweet talk.

05:02.460 --> 05:04.980
Those who break the rules like you lot

05:05.080 --> 05:06.240
-deserve severe punishment!
-deserve severe punishment!

05:06.240 --> 05:07.040
Enough.

05:08.000 --> 05:11.260
All this yelling and arguing
is not fit for decent company!

05:19.360 --> 05:21.460
Since they have apologized,

05:21.920 --> 05:23.800
let's stop pursuing the matter.

05:24.560 --> 05:28.200
Hurry up and go prepare for the match.

05:28.430 --> 05:29.940
-President Wan!
-President Wan!

05:29.940 --> 05:31.700
I mean, break it up.

05:32.120 --> 05:33.380
-Yes.
-Yes.

05:41.840 --> 05:43.300
Thank you, President Wan.

05:45.270 --> 05:48.409
[High Art]

05:49.409 --> 05:50.450
Oh, no.

05:50.480 --> 05:52.360
I really can't do this anymore.

05:53.040 --> 05:54.900
It's like my waist is breaking.

05:55.360 --> 05:56.920
My legs!

05:59.960 --> 06:01.440
I can't keep this up.

06:02.200 --> 06:03.720
Please spare me.

06:03.720 --> 06:04.650
Pace yourself.

06:04.670 --> 06:06.760
Hang in there.

06:12.150 --> 06:15.480
Why doesn't she need to practice?

06:19.360 --> 06:20.900
For a martial arts practitioner,

06:20.900 --> 06:22.500
these are just basic skills.

06:27.760 --> 06:29.410
Look how cocky she is.

06:29.760 --> 06:30.840
Come on.

06:31.200 --> 06:33.330
Press my legs harder.

06:34.370 --> 06:37.960
[High Art]

06:57.920 --> 07:00.180
That flute is from your hometown, right?

07:01.050 --> 07:02.250
Don't be nervous.

07:02.400 --> 07:04.850
I'm here to send you a handsome gift.

07:06.500 --> 07:07.360
President Wan,

07:07.950 --> 07:09.430
we are on different sides.

07:09.840 --> 07:11.490
We have nothing to talk about.

07:11.490 --> 07:14.550
No wonder you could be a centurion
in the Chilian Tribe.

07:14.570 --> 07:15.510
It seems

07:15.540 --> 07:18.500
I'd better present a big enough gift.

07:19.290 --> 07:20.360
Cut the crap.

07:20.680 --> 07:21.740
Just speak your mind.

07:21.740 --> 07:22.540
Fine.

07:23.320 --> 07:25.230
I'm looking to make a deal with you.

07:25.230 --> 07:27.940
As long as you help me
fight against Nan Yanzhi,

07:27.970 --> 07:29.540
I promise I will

07:29.570 --> 07:31.570
let you go back to the Chilian Tribe.

07:35.270 --> 07:38.180
[High Art]

07:49.280 --> 07:51.740
All guiding rings for the voice-keepers
in Lingya Tower

07:51.740 --> 07:54.560
are sized
according to their left ring fingers.

07:54.580 --> 07:56.240
As for the size of this ring...

07:58.790 --> 07:59.710
See?

08:00.480 --> 08:04.480
It shows that the owner of this ring
has much slenderer fingers than I do.

08:06.330 --> 08:08.860
I don't find anything
noticeably suspicious

08:09.130 --> 08:11.650
about these girls' speech and behavior.

08:12.600 --> 08:14.390
But as Master said,

08:14.780 --> 08:16.510
I must not easily trust anyone.

08:57.240 --> 08:59.920
People who have worked as voice-keepers
stay alert all the time.

08:59.920 --> 09:03.520
She can't possibly miss
such an obvious assassination attempt.

09:16.560 --> 09:19.840
Could she be... on the Red Team?

09:59.760 --> 10:00.640
Who are you?

10:07.310 --> 10:08.430
Master.

10:09.740 --> 10:10.940
What brings you here?

10:11.300 --> 10:13.720
The Tower Master suddenly ordered me
to deliver a letter for him.

10:13.720 --> 10:15.210
I have a bad feeling

10:15.270 --> 10:16.990
that someone might harm you.

10:27.340 --> 10:29.140
Put this on to protect yourself.

10:31.320 --> 10:33.980
Isn't it the filigree bangle
I gave you as a gift?

10:34.520 --> 10:35.940
What exactly is going on?

10:36.050 --> 10:37.310
I'm still investigating it.

10:37.310 --> 10:39.890
Meanwhile, I'll try to keep you safe.

10:40.640 --> 10:41.360
Master, I...

10:41.360 --> 10:42.840
Now, go and get some sleep.

10:42.960 --> 10:44.490
Don't cause extra trouble.

10:45.320 --> 10:45.940
But...

10:45.970 --> 10:46.720
Just go.

11:04.240 --> 11:05.260
Nan Yanzhi.

11:09.320 --> 11:10.480
What a surprise...

11:21.360 --> 11:24.160
that you're acquainted
with the mute servant.

11:26.400 --> 11:27.640
Why are you like a cat,

11:27.680 --> 11:29.480
walking around without a sound?

11:30.510 --> 11:31.720
Nan Yanzhi,

11:32.080 --> 11:33.710
your death is not far off.

11:41.630 --> 11:42.960
Are you going to kill me?

11:43.590 --> 11:44.920
I am not the one planning

11:45.440 --> 11:46.320
to kill you.

11:47.840 --> 11:50.370
Today, Wan Hongliu approached me
in private,

11:50.660 --> 11:52.720
asking me to join her in fighting you.

11:53.100 --> 11:55.540
At this time of year,
people in the Chilian Tribe

11:55.540 --> 11:57.630
would slaughter cattle and sheep

11:57.930 --> 11:59.160
to celebrate the turn of the year.

11:59.160 --> 12:00.320
At night,

12:00.340 --> 12:03.210
everyone would gather around the bonfire,
singing, dancing,

12:03.210 --> 12:04.540
and drinking heartily.

12:06.390 --> 12:08.250
Now is the perfect time, isn't it?

12:08.680 --> 12:10.140
As long as agree to help me,

12:10.420 --> 12:12.950
you'll just be in time
to go home for the event.

12:17.290 --> 12:20.620
It's a shame
that all my tribespeople are gone now.

12:22.530 --> 12:23.980
At this time last year,

12:24.010 --> 12:25.810
there was a traitor in our tribe.

12:26.130 --> 12:28.030
All my fellow tribe members were killed.

12:28.030 --> 12:28.750
And I was...

12:29.300 --> 12:31.830
falsely accused
of colluding with the enemy,

12:32.320 --> 12:34.050
which reduced me to this state.

12:37.890 --> 12:39.010
Therefore,

12:39.830 --> 12:41.230
in my whole life,

12:41.600 --> 12:43.040
there's nothing I hate

12:43.320 --> 12:45.420
more than traitors.

12:48.200 --> 12:50.840
What we the Chilian tribespeople
despise most

12:50.920 --> 12:53.930
is such backstabbing and shady schemes.

12:54.040 --> 12:55.080
Tu Ya, I was simply...

12:55.080 --> 12:55.640
Alright.

12:56.640 --> 12:58.280
It's not safe to stay here for long.

12:58.280 --> 12:59.330
We'd better hurry back.

12:59.330 --> 13:00.170
Tu Ya.

13:00.600 --> 13:02.070
Tu Ya, thank you.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.840
I once said
we would leave this place together.

13:03.840 --> 13:05.480
I believe we can make it happen.

13:05.480 --> 13:08.160
Save that speech after we survive
tomorrow's death match.

13:08.160 --> 13:09.240
You have fought many battles,

13:09.240 --> 13:10.220
so you certainly understand

13:10.220 --> 13:11.510
that there are always opportunities

13:11.510 --> 13:13.150
for us till the last moment comes.

13:13.150 --> 13:14.350
Opportunities?

13:15.240 --> 13:16.880
Under my watch,

13:17.040 --> 13:19.400
you will not have one single opportunity.

13:39.840 --> 13:40.520
Everyone,

13:41.160 --> 13:43.550
welcome to the Great Hall of Elegance.

13:43.940 --> 13:46.540
The first round is a dance competition.

13:46.830 --> 13:48.100
The Red and Blue Teams

13:48.360 --> 13:51.300
will each finish a dance
to a provided tune.

13:51.640 --> 13:55.730
The winning team will be decided
based on the quality of the performances.

13:55.730 --> 13:56.770
The first round

13:57.280 --> 13:59.080
officially begins now.

14:32.760 --> 14:34.690
Lingya Tower is truly

14:34.720 --> 14:36.620
a place of hidden talents.

14:36.680 --> 14:38.560
Look at the dance of these beauties.

14:38.560 --> 14:41.030
They are all graceful and charming.

14:41.050 --> 14:43.620
Even the top courtesans
of the Moon House in the capital

14:43.620 --> 14:45.550
might not dance better than them.

14:45.570 --> 14:46.870
I agree.

14:46.900 --> 14:48.790
The Red Team is going to win!

14:51.360 --> 14:52.340
My Lady.

15:12.440 --> 15:13.760
Look how cocky they are.

15:13.760 --> 15:14.790
It's your turn.

15:20.350 --> 15:21.900
I forgot to tell you something.

15:21.900 --> 15:24.620
The girl who causes the team
to lose at the end

15:25.180 --> 15:26.650
will be killed.

15:26.680 --> 15:27.900
Killed?

15:27.930 --> 15:29.620
You didn't say that at the beginning.

15:29.620 --> 15:31.700
This last-minute statement
shouldn't be valid, right?

15:31.700 --> 15:34.560
President Wan, you're informing us
of a new rule just when our turn arrives.

15:34.560 --> 15:36.540
This is meant to disturb
our peace of mind, isn't it?

15:36.540 --> 15:39.410
If I had kept it from you
till the end of the competition,

15:39.410 --> 15:41.410
it would be even worse, wouldn't it?

15:41.480 --> 15:43.010
On this floor managed by me,

15:43.200 --> 15:45.370
only one person will die in each round.

15:47.670 --> 15:50.070
You're better off here than anywhere else.

16:00.140 --> 16:00.820
Oh no.

16:01.050 --> 16:02.470
What's the second move?

16:02.500 --> 16:04.340
Oh, stop talking, Dao.

16:04.360 --> 16:05.690
You're causing me to forget stuff too.

16:05.690 --> 16:06.970
Isn't our captain right ahead?

16:06.970 --> 16:08.170
Just follow her lead.

16:22.700 --> 16:23.830
Man!

16:24.160 --> 16:25.240
That was an honest mistake.

16:25.240 --> 16:27.130
I beg for another chance,
President Wan! I...
